  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-05-27T15:05:46.952Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "VRChat Version: 2022.2.1p1 Build 1202\nAfter the big IK2.0 update the eye blinking animation plays much more often and much faster than before. Simulated gaze \"switching target\" very often, as a result eyes look twitchy. Eyes rotate to max angles which didn't happen that often before the update. When laying down in fbt eyes keep looking up most of the time.\nThe same thing happens on avatars that were not reuploaded after the update and on avatars that were uploaded again using the latest SDK without making any changes in the \"Eye Look\" section of the descriptor. At least 2 of my friends are experiencing same or similar unusual eye movement.\nSteps to reproduce: Observe the eye movement in a mirror or the camera. For the issue with the eyes always looking up lay down on the back in FBT and look in a mirror.",
